429	    /**
430	     * Assign the attributes that are derived once, at creation time, and stored on the owner: its
431	     * {@link #memberId(Owner) memberId}, {@link #namesakeCount(String, String) namesakeCount},
432	     * {@link #isBulkSignup(LocalDate) bulk-signup warning}, {@link #isCityApproachingCapacity(String)
433	     * capacity warning}, {@link #householdSize(String)
434	     * householdSize} and {@link #membershipLevel(Owner) membershipLevel}. Each is computed from the
435	     * owner's own fields together with the owners already present, so this runs after the owner has
436	     * been validated and has passed the duplicate and capacity checks, and immediately before it is
437	     * persisted.
